# Hackl in the café (D-105 axe rules; D-104: no H-box in Stage 9, so the
# Hackl is carried in). The test route of
# flow_m6_hackl_bad_ischl_to_cafe_zauner (the `hackl` level in Bad
# Ischl's slot, station 8 of 9) and its 2076 frames: the hackl run's
# Maibaum (1343), the tally, the route map, the Café Zauner intro (2016)
# drawn with Hackl Resi; play from 2166 as Hackl (score 5450, lives 3).
# She hops onto the ?-box at 17 (2331) and waits; as Kellner #1 comes
# back towards the vitrine she throws an axe (2501): it bounces off his
# tray (AxeHit 2546, no points, he walks on). A beam search (no hurt,
# Hackl kept, no RUN) to Vitrine D: tray bounces off Kellner #1 (2616)
# and #2 (2775) up to L1, Vitrine B, a stomp on Kurgast #1 (2961),
# Vitrine C, Vitrine D (3106). From its top she throws an axe over the
# queue (3141): it comes down on the third Wartender (col 79): defeated,
# 100 (3185).
# Then a beam search (no hurt, Hackl kept, no RUN) over L3 and six
# Wartende (stomps 3320 ... 3494), the checkpoint (3647), the Tortenvitrine
# (3727) onto the arena floor (3764); she walks to the arena's middle and
# the arena locks (3827, „Hinten anstellen!"). From the lock on the inputs
# are m7_boss_win_hackl's from its lock (468): an axe in his first
# telegraph bounces off the tray (AxeHit 3944, no points); she stays on
# the floor and jumps every dash as it passes under her (3980, 4205,
# 4424); one axe in each breather: hits at 4090 (left wall), 4311 (right
# wall) and 4514 (left wall), 1000 + 1000 + 5000; right after the first
# hit a second axe flies through the stunned waiter (4095, no hit). Every
# breather is hit, so no volley comes. Then the counter: the armed
# goal_stollen (4703, 10 000); the replay ends in the Serve (4715).
